  "review": "<h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-stone-900 border-b-2 border-amber-500 pb-2 mb-4\">【島根県の温泉完全ガイド】名湯ランキング＆露天風呂付きおすすめ旅館10選</h2>\n<p class=\"text-sm text-stone-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\">島根県が誇る風情ある温泉街や隠れ家温泉リゾート。泉質の特徴や美肌効果、四季折々の絶景を楽しめる露天風呂、地元島根県の旬の食材（出雲そば・松江のしじみ汁・隠岐の岩ガキ・島根和牛など）を味わえる極上宿を紹介します。</p>\n\n<div class=\"my-6 p-6 bg-gradient-to-br from-amber-50 to-orange-50/50 border border-amber-200 rounded-3xl shadow-sm\">\n  <h3 class=\"text-base font-bold text-amber-950 mb-3 flex items-center gap-2\">♨️ 島根県の温泉エリアとおすすめポイント</h3>\n  <p class=\"text-xs text-stone-700 leading-relaxed mb-2\">島根県の豊かな自然に包まれながら楽しむ名湯ステイ。記念日のお祝いから週末の癒やし旅まで、心に残る上質な時間を過ごせます。</p>\n  <div class=\"p-3 bg-amber-100/50 rounded-2xl border border-amber-200 text-xs text-amber-950\">\n    <strong>注目の温泉・宿泊エリア：</strong> 玉造・松江しんじ湖・有福・温泉津・出雲大社周辺温泉（紅葉露天・雪見風呂・日本三大そば・出雲割子そば会席）</div>\n</div>\n\n<h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-stone-900 border-b border-amber-300 pb-1 mt-6 mb-3\">🏨 島根県の主要エリア別おすすめ温泉宿</h3>\n<div class=\"space-y-4 my-4\">\n          <div class=\"p-4 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-stone-200 shadow-2xs\">\n            <h4 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 mb-1.5 flex items-center gap-2\">\n              <span class=\"text-amber-500 font-bold\">♨️</span> 出雲大社・松江・玉造温泉エリアの温泉・宿\n            </h4>\n            <p class=\"text-xs text-stone-600 leading-relaxed mb-2\">島根県を代表する観光名所・絶景スポット・名湯が凝縮された一番人気エリア。</p>\n            <ul class=\"text-xs text-stone-700 space-y-1.5 list-disc list-inside bg-stone-50 p-3 rounded-xl\"><li><a href=\"https://hb.afl.rakuten.co.jp/hgc/54d2a438.4bc4abc2.54d2a439.aa1be583/?pc=https%3A%2F%2Ftravel.rakuten.co.jp%2FHOTEL%2F7799%2F7799.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"underline hover:text-amber-700\"><strong>松江しんじ湖温泉　皆美館（みなみかん）</strong></a>（松江市末次本町14 ／ 評価 ⭐4.86・目安 ¥21,340〜）</li><li><a href=\"https://hb.afl.rakuten.co.jp/hgc/54d2a438.4bc4abc2.54d2a439.aa1be583/?pc=https%3A%2F%2Ftravel.rakuten.co.jp%2FHOTEL%2F17912%2F17912.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"underline hover:text-amber-700\"><strong>さぎの湯温泉　さぎの湯荘</strong></a>（安来市古川町478-1 ／ 評価 ⭐4.76・目安 ¥23,100〜）</li><li><a href=\"https://hb.afl.rakuten.co.jp/hgc/54d2a438.4bc4abc2.54d2a439.aa1be583/?pc=https%3A%2F%2Ftravel.rakuten.co.jp%2FHOTEL%2F52116%2F52116.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"underline hover:text-amber-700\"><strong>松江しんじ湖温泉　なにわ一水</strong></a>（松江市千鳥町63 ／ 評価 ⭐4.7・目安 ¥13,850〜）</li></ul>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n<h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-stone-900 border-b border-amber-300 pb-1 mt-6 mb-3\">💡 島根県の温泉宿選び＆予約のコツ</h3>\n<ul class=\"text-xs text-stone-700 space-y-1.5 list-disc list-inside bg-white p-4 rounded-xl border border-stone-200\">\n  <li><strong>客室露天風呂・貸切風呂：</strong> プライベートな空間で温泉を満喫したいカップル・ファミリーに大人気</li>\n  <li><strong>料理自慢の宿：</strong> 島根県ならではの郷土料理やブランド牛、新鮮な山海の幸を堪能できるプランを選択</li>\n  <li><strong>お得な予約タイミング：</strong> 楽天トラベルの「5と0のつく日」や限定クーポンを活用してお得に予約</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-stone-900 border-b border-amber-300 pb-1 mt-6 mb-3\">🏆 島根県の温泉旅館・ホテルおすすめランキング10選【楽天トラベル公式データ】</h3>\n<div class=\"space-y-4 my-4\">\n  <div class=\"p-4 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-stone-200 shadow-2xs space-y-2\">\n    <div class=\"flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-3 items-center\">\n      <img src=\"https://img.travel.rakuten.co.jp/share/HOTEL/7799/7799.jpg\" alt=\"松江しんじ湖温泉　皆美館（みなみかん）\" class=\"w-full md:w-36 h-24 object-cover rounded-xl shadow-inner flex-shrink-0\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n      <div class=\"flex-grow space-y-1\">\n        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n          <span class=\"px-2 py-0.5 bg-amber-600 text-white font-black text-[10px] rounded-md\">第1位</span>\n          <h4 class=\"font-bold text-stone-900 text-sm leading-snug\">松江しんじ湖温泉　皆美館（みなみかん）</h4>\n        </div>\n        <p class=\"text-[11px] text-stone-600\">📍 島根県松江市末次本町14 ｜ 🚃 ＪＲ山陰本線「松江駅」よりタクシーで１０分　高速山陰道松江西インターより車で10分</p>\n        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 text-xs text-stone-700\">\n          <span class=\"text-amber-600 font-bold\">⭐ 4.86（358件）</span>\n          <span class=\"font-bold text-stone-900\">目安: ¥21,340〜</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <p class=\"text-xs text-stone-700 bg-stone-50 p-2 rounded-lg border border-stone-100\">130年の歴史に多くの文人に愛され「和のオーベルジュ」を取り入れた皆美</p>\n    <div class=\"text-right pt-1\">\n      <a href=\"https://hb.afl.rakuten.co.jp/hgc/54d2a438.4bc4abc2.54d2a439.aa1be583/?pc=https%3A%2F%2Ftravel.rakuten.co.jp%2FHOTEL%2F7799%2F7799.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"inline-block px-5 py-2 bg-gradient-to-r from-amber-500 to-orange-500 text-white font-bold text-xs rounded-xl shadow hover:opacity-95 transition\">\n        楽天トラベルでプラン・空室を見る ≫\n      </a>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"p-4 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-stone-200 shadow-2xs space-y-2\">\n    <div class=\"flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-3 items-center\">\n      <img src=\"https://img.travel.rakuten.co.jp/share/HOTEL/17912/17912.jpg\" alt=\"さぎの湯温泉　さぎの湯荘\" class=\"w-full md:w-36 h-24 object-cover rounded-xl shadow-inner flex-shrink-0\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n      <div class=\"flex-grow space-y-1\">\n        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n          <span class=\"px-2 py-0.5 bg-amber-600 text-white font-black text-[10px] rounded-md\">第2位</span>\n          <h4 class=\"font-bold text-stone-900 text-sm leading-snug\">さぎの湯温泉　さぎの湯荘</h4>\n        </div>\n        <p class=\"text-[11px] text-stone-600\">📍 島根県安来市古川町478-1 ｜ 🚃 ＪＲ安来駅よりバスにて１５分／山陰道安来ＩＣより１０分</p>\n        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 text-xs text-stone-700\">\n          <span class=\"text-amber-600 font-bold\">⭐ 4.76（775件）</span>\n          <span class=\"font-bold text-stone-900\">目安: ¥23,100〜</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <p class=\"text-xs text-stone-700 bg-stone-50 p-2 rounded-lg border border-stone-100\">足立美術館から徒歩30秒。その昔、鷺が傷を癒したことから名づけられた薬効高い源泉掛け流し温泉。</p>\n    <div class=\"text-right pt-1\">\n      <a href=\"https://hb.afl.rakuten.co.jp/hgc/54d2a438.4bc4abc2.54d2a439.aa1be583/?pc=https%3A%2F%2Ftravel.rakuten.co.jp%2FHOTEL%2F17912%2F17912.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"inline-block px-5 py-2 bg-gradient-to-r from-amber-500 to-orange-500 text-white font-bold text-xs rounded-xl shadow hover:opacity-95 transition\">\n        楽天トラベルでプラン・空室を見る ≫\n      </a>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"p-4 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-stone-200 shadow-2xs space-y-2\">\n    <div class=\"flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-3 items-center\">\n      <img src=\"https://img.travel.rakuten.co.jp/share/HOTEL/52116/52116.jpg\" alt=\"松江しんじ湖温泉　なにわ一水\" class=\"w-full md:w-36 h-24 object-cover rounded-xl shadow-inner flex-shrink-0\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n      <div class=\"flex-grow space-y-1\">\n        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n          <span class=\"px-2 py-0.5 bg-amber-600 text-white font-black text-[10px] rounded-md\">第3位</span>\n          <h4 class=\"font-bold text-stone-900 text-sm leading-snug\">松江しんじ湖温泉　なにわ一水</h4>\n        </div>\n        <p class=\"text-[11px] text-stone-600\">📍 島根県松江市千鳥町63 ｜ 🚃 ＪＲ　松江駅より車で約１０分</p>\n        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 text-xs text-stone-700\">\n          <span class=\"text-amber-600 font-bold\">⭐ 4.7（893件）</span>\n          <span class=\"font-bold text-stone-900\">目安: ¥13,850〜</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <p class=\"text-xs text-stone-700 bg-stone-50 p-2 rounded-lg border border-stone-100\">ようこそ、極上の湖畔ステイへ―――上質を知る、大人のための温泉宿。</p>\n    <div class=\"text-right pt-1\">\n      <a href=\"https://hb.afl.rakuten.co.jp/hgc/54d2a438.4bc4abc2.54d2a439.aa1be583/?pc=https%3A%2F%2Ftravel.rakuten.co.jp%2FHOTEL%2F52116%2F52116.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"inline-block px-5 py-2 bg-gradient-to-r from-amber-500 to-orange-500 text-white font-bold text-xs rounded-xl shadow hover:opacity-95 transition\">\n        楽天トラベルでプラン・空室を見る ≫\n      </a>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"p-4 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-stone-200 shadow-2xs space-y-2\">\n    <div class=\"flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-3 items-center\">\n      <img src=\"https://img.travel.rakuten.co.jp/share/HOTEL/160909/160909.jpg\" alt=\"いにしえの宿　佳雲（共立リゾート）\" class=\"w-full md:w-36 h-24 object-cover rounded-xl shadow-inner flex-shrink-0\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n      <div class=\"flex-grow space-y-1\">\n        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n          <span class=\"px-2 py-0.5 bg-amber-600 text-white font-black text-[10px] rounded-md\">第4位</span>\n          <h4 class=\"font-bold text-stone-900 text-sm leading-snug\">いにしえの宿　佳雲（共立リゾート）</h4>\n        </div>\n        <p class=\"text-[11px] text-stone-600\">📍 島根県出雲市大社町修理免字本郷1443-1 ｜ 🚃 一畑電車『出雲大社前駅』　徒歩15分・ＪＲ『出雲市駅』→バス20分（正門前下車徒歩8分）</p>\n        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 text-xs text-stone-700\">\n          <span class=\"text-amber-600 font-bold\">⭐ 4.7（1162件）</span>\n          <span class=\"font-bold text-stone-900\">目安: ¥19,250〜</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <p class=\"text-xs text-stone-700 bg-stone-50 p-2 rounded-lg border border-stone-100\">出雲大社まで徒歩8分。出雲神話や伝統を感じられる設え。「大社の湯」が堪能出来る贅を尽くした和の湯宿。</p>\n    <div class=\"text-right pt-1\">\n      <a href=\"https://hb.afl.rakuten.co.jp/hgc/54d2a438.4bc4abc2.54d2a439.aa1be583/?pc=https%3A%2F%2Ftravel.rakuten.co.jp%2FHOTEL%2F160909%2F160909.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"inline-block px-5 py-2 bg-gradient-to-r from-amber-500 to-orange-500 text-white font-bold text-xs rounded-xl shadow hover:opacity-95 transition\">\n        楽天トラベルでプラン・空室を見る ≫\n      </a>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"p-4 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-stone-200 shadow-2xs space-y-2\">\n    <div class=\"flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-3 items-center\">\n      <img src=\"https://img.travel.rakuten.co.jp/share/HOTEL/78179/78179.jpg\" alt=\"出雲・玉造温泉　白石家\" class=\"w-full md:w-36 h-24 object-cover rounded-xl shadow-inner flex-shrink-0\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n      <div class=\"flex-grow space-y-1\">\n        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n          <span class=\"px-2 py-0.5 bg-amber-600 text-white font-black text-[10px] rounded-md\">第5位</span>\n          <h4 class=\"font-bold text-stone-900 text-sm leading-snug\">出雲・玉造温泉　白石家</h4>\n        </div>\n        <p class=\"text-[11px] text-stone-600\">📍 島根県松江市玉湯町玉造44-2 ｜ 🚃 【山陰道】玉造インターから車で約１０分 ■出雲大社から車で約４０分の距離 ■ＪＲ玉造温泉駅より送迎有（事前連絡要）</p>\n        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 text-xs text-stone-700\">\n          <span class=\"text-amber-600 font-bold\">⭐ 4.69（4013件）</span>\n          <span class=\"font-bold text-stone-900\">目安: ¥12,500〜</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <p class=\"text-xs text-stone-700 bg-stone-50 p-2 rounded-lg border border-stone-100\">【ご縁に結ばれて創業300年】楽天トラベルアワード11年連続受賞施設！口コミ総数3,326件☆</p>\n    <div class=\"text-right pt-1\">\n      <a href=\"https://hb.afl.rakuten.co.jp/hgc/54d2a438.4bc4abc2.54d2a439.aa1be583/?pc=https%3A%2F%2Ftravel.rakuten.co.jp%2FHOTEL%2F78179%2F78179.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"inline-block px-5 py-2 bg-gradient-to-r from-amber-500 to-orange-500 text-white font-bold text-xs rounded-xl shadow hover:opacity-95 transition\">\n        楽天トラベルでプラン・空室を見る ≫\n      </a>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"p-4 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-stone-200 shadow-2xs space-y-2\">\n    <div class=\"flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-3 items-center\">\n      <img src=\"https://img.travel.rakuten.co.jp/share/HOTEL/7798/7798.jpg\" alt=\"玉造温泉　佳翠苑　皆美\" class=\"w-full md:w-36 h-24 object-cover rounded-xl shadow-inner flex-shrink-0\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n      <div class=\"flex-grow space-y-1\">\n        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n          <span class=\"px-2 py-0.5 bg-amber-600 text-white font-black text-[10px] rounded-md\">第6位</span>\n          <h4 class=\"font-bold text-stone-900 text-sm leading-snug\">玉造温泉　佳翠苑　皆美</h4>\n        </div>\n        <p class=\"text-[11px